body:
@cbuescher  You are actually right. I thought this happened all the time, but it's only in some cases.
In my case I had a range query in the filter context, this reproduces the issue as well:

edit: it's not the filter context, with must it's the same. It's apparently the range query (at least in my case). A term query doesn't do it. 

```json
{
  "size": 0,
  "aggs": {
    "test": {
      "filters": {
        "filters": [
          {
            "bool": {
              "filter": {
                "range": {
                  "somefield": {
                    "gte": 170071352479318000
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
```
